  "body": "## Ask\n\nValidate priority scheduling (`--enable-priority-scheduling`) combined with the other features we run: PD disaggregation, prefix caching and KV offload to host RAM. The goal is no correctness or stability issues.\n\nTest on two models:\n\n- **GPT-OSS-120B**, which uses sliding window attention, at 128K context.\n- **Qwen3-VL**, with multimodal requests (images, video), at 128K and 256K context.\n",
